ibute-label Slow\">slow</span>. Enemies can <span class=\"highlight\">Parry</span> this attack.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">You and your allies have increased Air Control.</span>","descriptionRu":"Создаёт кулак, который бьёт и <panel class=\"InlineAttributeIcon KnockUp\" replacechar=\"_\"><span class=\"InlineAttributeName KnockUp\">подбрасывает</span> всех в области действия. <br><br>Враги получают <img src=\"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/hud/core/icon_damage_melee.png\" class=\"inline-attribute MeleeDamage\" alt=\"урон ближнего боя\"/><span class=\"inline-attribute-label MeleeDamage\" style=\"color: #EC9719;\">урон ближнего боя</span> и <panel class=\"InlineAttributeIcon Slow\" replacechar=\"_\"><span class=\"InlineAttributeName Slow\">замедляются</span>. Эту атаку можно <span class=\"highlight\">парировать</span>.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">У вас и союзников улучшается управление в воздухе.</span>","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":